

--------

PWRUP - Power Up Count - Number of engine start events

RUNCNT - Run Count - Number of engine run cycles

EOT - Engine Operating Time - Total accumulated operating time 

LCF1, LCF3, LCF4 - Low Cycle Fatigue Zone 1, Zone 3, Zone4 - Fatigue cycles accumulated in different zones of engine

TAC - Total Accumulated Cycles - Total thermal/mechanical cycles

AUGLIT - Augmentor Lit Time - Time with afterburner engaged

AUGOT - Augmentor Operating Time - Total afterburner operating time

AUGLITR1 / AUGLITR2 - Augmentor Lit Time (Zone 1 / Zone 2).

ABRECR1_RUN / ABRECR2_RUN - Afterburner Recycle counts per run.

N1 - Fan Speed (Low Pressure Rotor Speed).

N2 - Core Speed (High Pressure Rotor Speed).

T3 - Compressor Discharge Temperature.

T41 - Turbine Inlet Temperature

T6 - Exhaust Gas Temperature.

HST_L1_THR - Hot Section Time Level 1 Threshold - Time at Level 1 hot section temperature

FAN - Fan Module usage index

COMP - Compressor Module usage index

COMB - Combustor Module usage index

HPT - High-Pressure Turbine usage index

LPT - Low-Pressure Turbine usage index

NOZZLE - Exhaust Nozzle actuator usage.

BEARING - Bearing stress or usage index

EFT - Engine Flight Time - Total flight time accumulated

FLTCNT - Flight Count - Number of flights

ERLT - Engine Run Life Time - Remaining life time estimate

AICNT / AI_OPN - Anti-Ice Count / Anti-Ice Open - Time/Cycles the anti-ice system was active

PB_TSEC - Burner Pressure Time Seconds - Time at elevated burner pressure

PB_MAX - Burner Pressure Maximum - Maximum burner pressure

TestBed - Test Bed Identifier

--------------------

ENGINE_SN - Engine Serial Number - Unique identifier for the engine being inspected

DEFECT_DTG - Defect Date Time Group - Date/time when defect was recorded

JCN - Job Control Number - Maintenance process identifier 

WCE - Work Center Event - Subtask number in maintenance process

PART_NO - Part Number - Part number of the inspected component 

POSITION_ID - Position Identifier - Position code on the component 

SUBPOSITION_ID - Sub-Position Identifier - Sub-location within the position

LOCATION_X - Location X Coordinate - X-axis coordinate of defect on part surface

LOCATION_Y - Location Y Coordinate - Y-axis coordinate of defect on part surface

DEFECT_NO - Defect Number Sequential identifier for defects on this part 

AREA - Defect Area - Measured coating loss area

BASE - Base Location - Air base where inspection occurred (maps to SRAN)
